helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150792				0	pl	Zwracana wartość:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150398				0	pl	Data				20200411 15:09:53
