helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3109813				0	pl	\<bookmark_value\>LOG, funkcja\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>logarytmy\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
