helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D9				0	pl	Naciśnij klawisz \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Backspace\</item\>, aby usunąć numer.				20200411 15:09:53
