helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\printing_order.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	pl	Wybierz \<emph\>Plik - Drukuj\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\printing_order.xhp	0	help	par_id3149836				0	pl	Kliknij kartę \<emph\>Opcje\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
